    },
    {
      "name": "test_monotonicity_b",
      "intent": "If b < 5000, create a modified input with b increased by 1 (keeping n,a,s unchanged). Run both and assert the output for the modified input is not less than the original, for the same reason."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_scaling",
      "intent": "If doubling both a and b keeps them within [1,5000] (i.e., 2*a ≤ 5000 and 2*b ≤ 5000), create a modified input with a'=2*a and b'=2*b. Run both and assert the output for the modified input is exactly twice the original, because scaling both costs by a constant factor scales the total cost by the same factor."
