      "intent": "If n ≤ 10, compute the exact minimum cost by exhaustive enumeration of all valid partitions (first part must be a single character; each subsequent part either is a single character paying a, or is a substring of previous concatenation paying b, taking min(a,b) when both options exist). Assert the program's output equals this computed minimum."
    }
  ]
}

