      "name": "test_small_product_modular_consistency",
      "intent": "If the product D of A_i is less than MOD//6 (so that N*D < MOD), compute S = (output * D) % MOD. Then S must satisfy D ≤ S ≤ N*D, because S must equal the integer sum of LIS lengths over all X."
